# router.use(readOnlyRateLimiter) double-counts mutations

## Problem Statement

`follow.routes.ts:24` and `notifications.routes.ts:25` apply `readOnlyRateLimiter` globally via `router.use()`, then also apply `mutationRateLimiter` to POST/DELETE. Mutations consume two rate limit slots. Canonical `comments.routes.ts` applies rate limiters per-route only.

**Agent consensus: 1/8** (Pattern)

## Fix

Remove `router.use(readOnlyRateLimiter)` from both files. Add `readOnlyRateLimiter` explicitly to each GET handler.

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] No global `router.use(readOnlyRateLimiter)` in new route files
- [ ] Each GET handler has its own `readOnlyRateLimiter` middleware
- [ ] Mutations only consume one rate limit slot
